"post_instructions"}, {"type": "template_override", "content": 2}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "When we talk about making arrangements with supply companies we need to be clear from the beginning on what we actually want. Warranties must be "}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "in all of our contracts, that way we receive refunds in case something goes wrong. Also, clear \u201cvalued add\u201d policies"}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "included"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "include"}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "be written so that the suppliers don't use them as an excuse to ask for money. Finally, rates have to "}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "has to"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "have to"}], "id": 1}], "id": 1}, {"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "upon from the beginning, in that way the suppliers can't change prices at will. "}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_1"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "be agreed"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "be agree"}], "id": 1}], "id": 2}], "type": "MRW", "template_override": 2, "id": 9}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1}], "id": 0}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1, "id": 10}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " The perfect IT procurement of a contract"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}], "allowed_attempts": 2}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "enpe8n7le03ob11re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}], "responses": [{"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0}], "id": 0}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1, "id": 11}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "id": 2, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "enpe8n7le03ob11re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "100", "image": "enpe8n7le03ob11re2img01.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>: Now, one of the last things we need to decide before signing the contract is to establish the supplier's prices and fees for the IT procurement. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: That's right. If we intend to start this software business the best way possible, we cannot take any risk. Conditions must be set clear to reduce the possibility of having fees changed. Sometimes, supplier contracts often make reference to the supplier's \u201cthen current rate\u201d or allow the supplier to change their rates regularly, which give them the power to vary prices at will. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>: You're right. It is important for us, as customers, to find certainty in terms of price. What has been economically agreed has to be clearly expressed, so rates will not change unexpectedly causing us trouble."}, {"time": "42700", "image": "enpe8n7le03ob11re2img02.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: That's right. But can you tell me about the prices we're going to offer our clients? Apart from desktop software, operating systems, we're going to offer computer hardware and peripherals, right? Can you tell me if we plan to change the rates periodically? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>: Since price drives behavior, I think we're going to have to find some good commercial advice so we can come up with a good fee model. We also need to be careful that the limited exceptions contemplated by the fee schedule don't become the norm. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: What do you mean? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>: Well, not everything can become a value-added consulting service which is required on a time basis."}, {"time": "78900", "image": "enpe8n7le03ob11re2img03.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: What about taxes? I wonder if they are always included in IT procurement. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Pete</span>: Of course, all taxes other than GST, or Good and Services Tax, have to be included in the fee. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Susan</span>: Wow! I think I was underestimating all these prices and fees thing."}], "coverimg": "enpe8n7le03ob11re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0}]}